### Cenários manuais encadeados — formato REST Client (VS Code; também abre no JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Pré-requisito: `docker compose up -d --build --wait` (AUTH_MODE=disabled, API em :8080).
### Execute na ordem: cada passo usa o resultado do anterior.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@provider = provider-a

### 1. Abrir uma wallet com 100.00 BRL
# @name wallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{$guid}}",
  "initialBalance": { "amount": "100.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 2. BET de 25.00 → 200 PROCESSED, saldo 75.00
# @name bet
@betId = bet-{{$timestamp}}-{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{provider}}:{{betId}}

{
  "providerId": "{{provider}}",
  "externalTransactionId": "{{betId}}",
  "playerId": "{{wallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "demo-game",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "25.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 3. Reenvio idêntico → 200 com "idempotentReplay": true; o saldo continua 75.00
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{bet.request.headers.Idempotency-Key}}

{
  "providerId": "{{provider}}",
  "externalTransactionId": "{{bet.request.body.$.externalTransactionId}}",
  "playerId": "{{wallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "demo-game",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "25.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 4. Mesma chave com outro valor → 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_CONFLICT (não é replay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{bet.request.headers.Idempotency-Key}}

{
  "providerId": "{{provider}}",
  "externalTransactionId": "{{bet.request.body.$.externalTransactionId}}",
  "playerId": "{{wallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "demo-game",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "26.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 5. REFUND de uma aposta que ainda não chegou → 202 PENDING_REFERENCE
# @name lateRefund
@lateBetId = late-bet-{{$timestamp}}-{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{provider}}:refund-of-{{lateBetId}}

{
  "providerId": "{{provider}}",
  "externalTransactionId": "refund-of-{{lateBetId}}",
  "playerId": "{{wallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-2",
  "gameId": "demo-game",
  "kind": "REFUND",
  "money": { "amount": "10.00", "currency": "BRL" },
  "referenceExternalTransactionId": "{{lateBetId}}"
}

### 6. A aposta referenciada chega → 200; o worker resolve o REFUND logo em seguida
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{provider}}:{{lateBetId}}

{
  "providerId": "{{provider}}",
  "externalTransactionId": "{{lateBetId}}",
  "playerId": "{{wallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-2",
  "gameId": "demo-game",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "10.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 7. O REFUND agora está PROCESSED; saldo de volta a 75.00
GET {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions/{{lateRefund.response.body.transactionId}}

### 8. Saldo, ledger e reconciliação (saldo == ledger)
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{wallet.response.body.id}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{wallet.response.body.id}}/ledger?limit=20

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{wallet.response.body.id}}/reconciliation

### 9. BET acima do saldo → 422 REJECTED, INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS (persistida)
@bigBetId = big-bet-{{$timestamp}}-{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{provider}}:{{bigBetId}}

{
  "providerId": "{{provider}}",
  "externalTransactionId": "{{bigBetId}}",
  "playerId": "{{wallet.response.body.playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "roundId": "round-3",
  "gameId": "demo-game",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "500.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Com autenticação: `AUTH_MODE=keycloak docker compose --profile auth up -d --build --wait`
### Pegue um token e envie como `Authorization: Bearer <token>` nas requisições acima.
### provider-a / provider-b → operações de aposta; backoffice → wallets, ledger e reconciliação.

# @name token
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/wagering/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=backoffice&client_secret=backoffice-secret

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{wallet.response.body.id}}/ledger
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}
